---
description: Pega delivery conventions when using Prodigo tools
alwaysApply: false
---
- Pega rule and class names follow Org-App-Work-Case patterns; never invent a ruleset or class, read them from the technical design or the connected application.
- Builds go to an isolated branch through Prodigo; merging is a human action in Dev Studio.
- Long Prodigo jobs are polled with get_*_status; do not block on a start_* call.
